    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d645">

                <pb facs="0806" n="712" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg712"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Williams to Mr.
                            Rockhill.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Habana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-05-02"><hi rendition="#italic">May 2,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Can not say if Urbach was on board <hi rendition="#italic">Competitor</hi>, my
                    request to see prisoners and their names being yet refused</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
